== Done
Every Kubara component now has a base and a variant per cluster in ConfigHub.

Kubara generates something new for these bases. Each took it as one change,
in a change order. Review it, then take it through the stages:
  cub unit diff --space klab-0930-v16-argo-cd-base argo-cd -u --from=-1   # the change
  cub variant promote --change-order klab-0930-v16-argo-cd-base/kubara-generated-r4 --target-stage <stage>
  cub variant approve --change-order klab-0930-v16-argo-cd-base/kubara-generated-r4 --stage <stage>
  cub release publish <variant space> --revision ChangeOrder:klab-0930-v16-argo-cd-base/kubara-generated-r4
  cub unit diff --space klab-0930-v16-bootstrap-crds-base bootstrap-crds -u --from=-1   # the change
  cub variant promote --change-order klab-0930-v16-bootstrap-crds-base/kubara-generated-r4 --target-stage <stage>
  cub variant approve --change-order klab-0930-v16-bootstrap-crds-base/kubara-generated-r4 --stage <stage>
  cub release publish <variant space> --revision ChangeOrder:klab-0930-v16-bootstrap-crds-base/kubara-generated-r4
  cub unit diff --space klab-0930-v16-cert-manager-base cert-manager -u --from=-1   # the change
  cub variant promote --change-order klab-0930-v16-cert-manager-base/kubara-generated-r4 --target-stage <stage>
  cub variant approve --change-order klab-0930-v16-cert-manager-base/kubara-generated-r4 --stage <stage>
  cub release publish <variant space> --revision ChangeOrder:klab-0930-v16-cert-manager-base/kubara-generated-r4
  cub unit diff --space klab-0930-v16-traefik-base traefik -u --from=-1   # the change
  cub variant promote --change-order klab-0930-v16-traefik-base/kubara-generated-r4 --target-stage <stage>
  cub variant approve --change-order klab-0930-v16-traefik-base/kubara-generated-r4 --stage <stage>
  cub release publish <variant space> --revision ChangeOrder:klab-0930-v16-traefik-base/kubara-generated-r4
Before handover, Kubara's hub delivers from Git; handover points it at approved releases.

The change each base took, with the images it moves:
   1 +        image: docker.io/traefik:v3.7.13
   1 -        image: docker.io/traefik:v3.7.12
   7 +        image: quay.io/argoproj/argocd:v3.5.3
   7 -        image: quay.io/argoproj/argocd:v3.5.2

A change made in ConfigHub before the new catalog stays: the argo-cd base still
points Kubara's ApplicationSets at ConfigHub, as handover set it.
ApplicationSets in the argo-cd base that read ConfigHub: 5

